    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28742" root="عرف" body-key="E">[
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُرْفِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>Of,</i> or <i>relating to,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العُرْفُ</span> as meaning
<i>the commonly-known</i> or <i>commonly-received</i> or <i>conventional language,</i> or <i>common parlance,</i> or <i>common
usage.</i> Hence <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَقِيقَةٌ عُرْفِيَّةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجَازٌ عُرْفِىٌّ</span>, expl.
in arts. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حق</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جوز</span>.]

